OL,3,GNEWSALittering is down to 'ignorance
OL,4,Aand arrogance' - councillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dropping of litter and fly tipping
OL,7,Fis down to "ignorance and arrogance", a
OL,8,Fcouncillor has said.
OL,10,FBut with a unanimous decision from
OL,11,FNorth Norfolk District Council's
OL,12,Fcabinet to increase on-the-spot fixed
OL,13,Fpenalty notices (FPN) for littering
OL,14,Ffrom #80 to #500 and to raise
OL,15,Ffly-tipping fines, how will it work?
OL,17,FCallum Ringer, Liberal Democrat
OL,18,Fcouncillor, told BBC Radio Norfolk's
OL,19,FChris Goreham that the council's
OL,20,Fenforcement "relies on our officers
OL,21,Fwitnessing people littering".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
