OL,3,GNEWSALittering is down to 'ignorance
OL,4,Aand arrogance' - councillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "If our officers do catch
OL,7,Fanyone, our first instance is to say
OL,8,Fcan you pick that up and you know 99%
OL,9,Fwill."
